OL,3,AGPs, police and pharmacies among UK
OL,4,Aservices affected by Microsoft outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FKey services across the UK including
OL,7,Fthe NHS, GPs, police and pharmacies
OL,8,Fhave been affected by a global
OL,9,FMicrosoft outage.
OL,11,FNHS England said patients should still
OL,12,Fattend appointments unless told
OL,13,Fotherwise, while several large police
OL,14,Fforces are urging the public to call if
OL,15,Fthey want to report a crime. Schools
OL,16,Fhave also been affected by the outage.
OL,18,FMicrosoft said services were now
OL,19,Fgradually being restored globally after
OL,20,Fa problem caused by a higher-than-usual
OL,21,Fstress on its servers, but users could
OL,22,Fstill experience disruption.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
