OL,3,AZelensky welcomes US bringing Europe
OL,4,Ainto Russia-Ukraine peace talks
OL,5,
OL,6,FKushner and Witkoff met Zelensky in
OL,7,FDublin on Thursday evening as part of a
OL,8,Fbusy day of shuttle diplomacy - they
OL,9,Fmet Vladimir Putin in Moscow earlier,
OL,10,Fwho said that Russia's position on the
OL,11,Fwar - and its demand for territory -
OL,12,Fhas not changed.
OL,14,FThe meetings follow talks in Abu Dhabi
OL,15,Flast week that failed to reach a
OL,16,Fbreakthrough in ending the war.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
